<title>SPAIN: Iberdrola says to pay 31.25 ptas gross interim div.</title>
<headline>Iberdrola says to pay 31.25 ptas gross interim div.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish utility Iberdrola said on Wednesday it has approved an interim dividend payment of 31.25 pesetas gross against 1996 results, effective January 2.</p>
<p>This represents a payment of 23.44 pesetas net per share, and is the same amount as was paid against 1995 results.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
